Viktor 10.10.2026: «Жги переводы дальше, бро, и доводи всё до всех запланированных языков».

The catalogs: the dialogs (titles, bodies with their paragraphs, buttons), the toasts and menus, Engine (Updates, Models and LoRAs with the lab's catalog and fetch-heresy.sh's parts, Folders and their moves, the cards live), the Creator (the run's stages, the take's head, the lyrics' tools, the tag completer, find and replace, voices, decoders), the Library, the Writer's backup, the Refiner's chain, the Trainer, the help tips, the LoRA notes: about 1,240 keys a language beside the Artist's 300, each count in its language's forms. Every tr() of the page's code has its key now (389 of 389). Built by heresy/MISC/claude-i18n/1339/build_1339.py from batches checked for placeholders, numbers and Latin names, with no word of the root «раб» in Russian; a repo name rides in a placeholder, so the page carries no folder name (the build's guard).

1339c: where a dialog's body holds a list or the release notes, its own paragraphs go through tr() as the page builds it (the release offer, the 💎 sets, the machine as the studio found it, its toast); the art's trash counts in the language's forms; the Artist's shape chips leave their English to the translator; what a person or a machine named stays as written (a GPU's name, About's links, the Writer's documents and notes, a set's name, a derived take's name).

1339d: the lyrics' mirrors (.lyr-mirror, .lyr-tagsl, .tc-mirror) join KEEP: a typed line that happened to be a catalog key («End») was translated under the box and the marks slid off their letters; the run panel's style and cover prompt are translate="no"; the gutter's section name is a text of its own, so 1168's «куплет + мост» reaches it at last.

The suite: the seconds' pattern check reads texts no catalog has (the 💎 sets are translated now); 1339's own: the counts' forms in six languages, a Russian dialog with its paragraphs apart, the mirror as typed, the gutter in Russian. 626/0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
